<title>UK: Cable &amp; Wireless director sells 60,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Cable &amp; Wireless director sells 60,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Cable &amp; Wireless Plc said on Friday that director Stephen Pettit sold 60,084 ordinary shares on June 12 at 536p per share.</p>
<p>He made the share sale following the exercise of 69,099 share options.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
